{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbs of Duality is a simple but challenging puzzle game with elements from <strong>Sokoban</strong> and <strong>Minesweeper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to <strong>neutralize all walls</strong> that have <strong>fire</strong> or <strong>water</strong> inside them, with the opposite elements which is found around the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-1.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the game, more mechanics are added, such as <strong>combining adjacent elements</strong> to form larger ones (contributing 2 points to nearby walls), or <strong>splitting</strong> them apart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-2.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and <strong>bombs</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-3.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo currently includes <strong>40+ carefully hand-crafted levels</strong> but there are more to come.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615210?t=1745346597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/2e56504e217a0f34cf665a6f29674f2bbbbe19be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745346597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/ed98a04b0c45034f2467574165ee7bdbac9b437e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745346597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/ed98a04b0c45034f2467574165ee7bdbac9b437e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745346597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3673350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbs of Duality is a simple but challenging puzzle game with elements from <strong>Sokoban</strong> and <strong>Minesweeper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to <strong>neutralize all walls</strong> that have <strong>fire</strong> or <strong>water</strong> inside them, with the opposite elements which is found around the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-1.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the game, more mechanics are added, such as <strong>combining adjacent elements</strong> to form larger ones (contributing 2 points to nearby walls), or <strong>splitting</strong> them apart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-2.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and <strong>bombs</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/OOD-About-3.gif?t=1745346597\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo currently includes <strong>40+ carefully hand-crafted levels</strong> but there are more to come.</p>","developers":["Hexring"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/441cddc4b26ff219be87834b7300ad1f2cd8d62c/header.jpg?t=1745346597","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</st